        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imagina que estamos expandiendo nuestro juego con una clase jugable: el Caballero. Los Caballeros equipan un escudo y gritan una línea de batalla cuando atacan.</p><p>Dado que las subclases pueden tener sus propias <strong>propiedades</strong>, podemos agregar fácilmente estas características adicionales a un personaje.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Primero, necesitamos crear una subclase que tenga las mismas propiedades que su superclase. Haremos eso llamando al método <code>super()</code>.</p><p>Agrega el método <code>super()</code> para llamar al constructor de la superclase.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"259\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Queremos que la clase <code>Knight</code> tenga la misma propiedad <code>sprite</code> que la clase <code>Player</code>.</p><p>Usa <code>super(sprite)</code> para llamar al constructor de la clase <code>Player</code> y crear la propiedad <code>sprite</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" knight = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(knight.sprite);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"259\" /><option startIndex=\"259\" endIndex=\"260\" /><option startIndex=\"260\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>super</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>sprite</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos hacer la subclase <code>Knight</code> más específica añadiendo propiedades a ella. Necesitamos añadir cualquier propiedad extra después de <code>super()</code>.</p><p>Agrega un parámetro <code>battleLine</code> al constructor y guárdalo como una propiedad.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"260\" /><option startIndex=\"283\" endIndex=\"312\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite, battleLine) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine = battleLine;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" knight = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(knight.battleLine);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>battleLine</code> seguido de <code>this.battleLine = battleLine;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150053,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ahora que tenemos diferentes propiedades, podemos agregar métodos que usen estas propiedades.</p><p>Agrega la propiedad <code>this.battleLine</code> en el método <code>attack()</code> de la subclase para ver cómo se comporta el método en comparación con la superclase.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"409\" endIndex=\"424\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite, battleLine) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine = battleLine;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;wooden-stick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" knight = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"knight.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>this.battleLine</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150054,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con el método <code>attack()</code> personalizado, cada nueva instancia de <code>Knight</code> que creemos puede tener su propia línea de batalla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"498\" endIndex=\"504\" /><option startIndex=\"534\" endIndex=\"550\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite, battleLine) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine = battleLine;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" aria = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;No turning back!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" darius = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;golden-spear&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hold the line!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"aria.attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"darius.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>darius</code> seguido de <code>\"Hold the line!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
